      "content": "72 hours seems really fast. I guess that's why people call these things \"security breaches\"—it feels like someone is sneaking in and taking things behind your back. \n\nWhat about the data itself? Is there anything specific I should do to make sure my data isn't just sitting there vulnerable to these kinds of sneaky, hidden threats?",
